{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "92d214ef-c8b2-8a83-998c-86f420a26678",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:23:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello Kevin. This is Hector Salazar. I'm calling about, um, a drain. A catch basin. [pause] It's plugged up and the water just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a catch basin that's backed up. Where is it, Mr. Salazar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:17:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 103 Bellevue Avenue. I manage the property there. I've, uh, I've managed it a long time now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:17:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 103 Bellevue Avenue. And what's going on with it? I'm writing this down as we go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a snowbank. The plow pushed it right up against the basin, the one at the edge of the lane. And the melt can't get in. So the water, it pools right across the lane. [pause] Where was I. Yes, across the whole lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the snowbank is sitting on the grate and the melt is spreading across the lane instead of draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. That's exactly it. And it isn't a storm, you understand. It's dry out. Sunny even. It's just sitting there, day after day, and at night it freezes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll make a skating rink. How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, a while. Several days. [pause] Maybe more than a week. I called before, you know, about this same spot. Not the snow, a different time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What happened when you called before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:19:13-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A person told me it was a state road. That it wasn't the city's. So, nothing was done. And I'm, well, I'm tired of it, honestly. Nobody comes. It keeps happening and I keep calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me note that. Bellevue Avenue can be a mix depending on the stretch, so I'm going to flag this one and have somebody look at who handles that exact basin. If it's ours, we'll get a crew to clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:20:01-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would appreciate that. Because I was told one thing and the water doesn't care whose road it is. [pause] It's across the lane, where my tenants walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, and with it freezing overnight, that's a slip hazard. Is the water reaching the sidewalk or just the lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:20:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lane, and then it creeps toward the walk. Not so far yet. But it will, if nobody does anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, 103 Bellevue, snowbank blocking the catch basin, standing water across the lane, dry weather, been going on over a week, previously told state road. Did I get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:21:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Yes, that's all of it. You write well, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I talk to myself a lot. Can I get a number for you in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 401-555-0152."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:21:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0152. Good. Anything else about the spot, like is there a pole number or a landmark near the basin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:21:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. [pause] It's by the gate, at the edge of the lane, on the side nearest the driveway. I don't know a pole number. I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's plenty. By the gate, driveway side. I'll put that in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, Kevin, when it's done, would you call me back? I'd like to know it was cleared. Otherwise I'll be standing out there not knowing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:22:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll put a callback request on it so whoever closes it out rings you at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:22:28-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That's, um, that's what I need. [pause] I'm sorry, I lose my place sometimes. I'm on my way to pick up a cake, actually. A bakery, for a retirement party. So I'm a little scattered today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. Sounds like a nice errand. Hope the party goes well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:23:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So, you will send somebody, or you'll find out whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, one or the other. If it's state, we'll pass it to them directly rather than sending you around again. Either way you'll hear back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be a change. All right. I'll wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good, Mr. Salazar. Take care out there on the ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T13:23:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye, Kevin."
    }
  ],
